- **SH07 door-fix** — elevator doors now SLIDE (centre-parting), not swing. regenerateRefPlan with sliding-door revisionNote → start v3 + end v4 APPROVED.
- **SH09 regen** — after OpenAI top-up: start v4 + end v4 APPROVED, verdict=APPROVE, consistency=100 (was REGENERATE/78-82 + mismatched v1/v3 pair).
